OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APalestinian couple and teenage daughter
OL,4,Awho died in water off Shoreham named by
OL,5,Apolice
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo other children were on the shore at
OL,8,Fthe time of the incident and are now
OL,9,Fbeing cared for by their uncle,
OL,10,Faccording to the Palestinian Forum in
OL,11,FBritain
OL,13,FHassan El-Khawas was earlier identified
OL,14,Fas a Palestinian refugee by the
OL,15,FPalestinian embassy in London
OL,17,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it "a
OL,18,Freal terrible family tragedy" and warns
OL,19,Fabout "the dangers of open water
OL,20,Fswimming"
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
