OL,3,ATrack defect found near derailment site
OL,4,A- report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA defect was found on railway tracks in
OL,7,FEast Sussex at the site where a train
OL,8,Fderailed leaving 30 injured, a report
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FInitial findings from the Rail Accident
OL,12,FInvestigation Branch (RAIB) found an
OL,13,F"irregularity" with the tracks near
OL,14,FLewes where three carriages tumbled
OL,15,Fdown an embankment last Thursday.
OL,17,FThe RAIB, which is continuing to
OL,18,Finvestigate the derailment, said it had
OL,19,Freceived "several reports of rough
OL,20,Friding at the location of the
OL,21,Fderailment from passengers on other
OL,22,Ftrains".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
