OL,3,ASacked Ukrainian defence minister calls
OL,4,Afor presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's popular ex-defence minister
OL,7,FMykhailo Fedorov has called for wartime
OL,8,Felections, in what is widely seen as
OL,9,Fthe biggest challenge to Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky's presidency since Russia's
OL,11,Ffull-scale invasion four and a half
OL,12,Fyears ago.
OL,14,F"Democracy cannot be held hostage by
OL,15,FRussia," said Fedorov, 35, in a video
OL,16,Fposted to YouTube on Tuesday, adding
OL,17,Fthat Ukraine is fighting "precisely
OL,18,Fbecause we want to remain a free
OL,19,FEuropean state".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
